Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:29.15,Title,0,0,0,0,,《安娜贝尔2：诞生》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:40.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来找我）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（近了）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:13.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（找到你了）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.99,0:07:44.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（12年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:58.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣尤斯塔斯女孩之家）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:20.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来找我）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:58.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（这里）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.78,0:47:20.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（亲爱的日记 今天我回家了）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.88,1:11:19.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（找到你了）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.63,1:18:52.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拜托了）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.51,1:41:02.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣约阿希姆孤儿院）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.01,1:42:26.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（12年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为能躲过我的眼睛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you could hide from me, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到上面写了什么吗 上面写着我找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you read what it said? It said found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是没写我会挠… - 塞穆尔 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It didn't say tickle… - Samuel. Bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你肯定不想闹得太热了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't want to get overheated. - I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 因为轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Because now it's my turn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 帮帮忙 - 你叫帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, help! - You need help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我可以帮忙挠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh sure, I can help tickle you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这只脚丫子底肯定很好挠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the bottom of this feet might be very ticklish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该上床了 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for bed, Bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱你 妈妈 - 我更爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Love you, Mommy. - Love you more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就听一会 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just for a little while. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家后能玩娃娃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we play dollies when we get home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得如果你帮我洗碗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think if you help me with the washing up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我整个下午都能陪你玩娃娃 - 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can play dollies with you all afternoon. - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 埃斯特 - 早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Esther. - Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, busy Bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 我就想问问…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, just wondering…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我订的娃娃准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you got that order of mine ready yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的店里每天都有客人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got customers coming into my store everyday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,问起你的娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}asking about your dolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天可以让你儿子过来拿了 维克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can send your son over tomorrow, Vic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈雷路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hallelujah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来祈祷真的是能灵验的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess prayers do get answered, don't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 太谢谢你们了 祝你们有个愉快的周日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh right… well, thank you so much. You all have a good Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也是 - 祝你今天愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have a good day too. - You have a lovely day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In you get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,主语用语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有辆车来了 我能不能招呼他们停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a car coming, why don't I wave it down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们能不能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see if we can get some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.17,0:06:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用不用 我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去捡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,东南西北\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-l-u-e{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 选个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Pick a number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,北\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就能结交新的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will soon make new friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do my now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望我们能去个新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish you and me were going to a new home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是新的孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of a new orphanage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏宝贝也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Sue thinks too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有个家当然好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be nice to have a home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但是…有你才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but… only if you're there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想去没有你的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to go anywhere you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人要领养我们其中一个 另一个也要一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone wants one of us, they get both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.97,0:08:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.77,0:08:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最喜欢苏宝贝哪一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I like most about Sweet Sue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.83,0:09:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看上去和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks just like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多远 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how much further is it, Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母圣父圣子啊 你比孩子们还激动 修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Mary and Joseph. You're worse than the children, sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯夫妇愿意收留我们简直是上帝的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mullins agreeing to take us in was a gift from God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要得到礼物当然会激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of person isn't excited about getting a gift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得提醒一下 如果你们刚去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should mention don't be alarm if you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没怎么见到马林斯太太 不要紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't see much of Mrs Mullins at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…身体不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… has a condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她前几年遭遇了一场意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, she was in an accident years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有需要的话 你们几个女孩尽量帮帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You girls would do well to help her if need be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝 你需要帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice. You need help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 谢谢 我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks. I can manage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不幸患有小儿麻痹症\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's one of the unfortunate ones with that polio outbreak, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她每天都在变得更坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's getting stronger everyday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 她不会成为你的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't be a burden, I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯先生 你先带女孩们转转吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Mullins, why don't you show the girls around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她们的行李搬下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can unload their belongings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先看看里面吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直就像城堡一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. This is an amazing castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们肯定就是公主了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which obviously makes us the princesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的新孤儿院吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our new orphanage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这样就算我们永远不会被领养也行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is fine if we're never being adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视已经坏了 广播还可以用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The television no longer works, the radio however does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子真大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This goes on forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们可能需要地图才能找到路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. We're going to need a map to find our way around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你们所见 餐厅完全能容纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, the dining room is more than adequate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to accommodate all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Look here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们别走散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和马林斯太太一起住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Mullins and I stay in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼下除了这间房 其他地方都随便用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fell free to use the rest of the downstairs as you see fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的房间在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your rooms are upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.53,0:12:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Mullins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝和我能住在楼下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there someway Janice and I can maybe stay down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想要一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我几年前为我妻子安装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I installed it years ago for my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久没用了 但是还可以用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't been used in ages, but it works fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试 小珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it, Jan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不试 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.39,0:13:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,往上扳是往上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up is up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,往下扳是往下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是除非你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it won't work…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,系上安全带 才会动\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you click the seat belt in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个轮到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get to go next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,字幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.66,0:15:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这就是我们的房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess this is ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩睡这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take that side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特和蒂尔尼可以睡这两张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate and Tierney can have these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那琳达和我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Linda and me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 珍妮丝 这房子很大 还有别的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Janice. This is a big house, there are other bedrooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和琳达为什么不能睡在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't Linda and me have those over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.36,0:15:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那凯特和蒂尔尼睡哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but then, where would Kate and Tierney sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.45,0:15:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is neat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要这张床\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:15:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让它继续锁着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it stays that way too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jan. In here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想睡双层床吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna bunk beds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛特修女 我们能… - 主啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey sister Charlotte, can we… - Oh Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请赐予南茜不把别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please bless Nancy with the wisdom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓出心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}to not give people their heart attacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your emergency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能出去探索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go exploring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,先帮马赛神父收拾好你们的东西再…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help father Massey with your things first and then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是马林斯先生坚持要我们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Mr Mullins insist that we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不代表你就不用…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean you don't have to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道马赛牧师这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how Father Massey is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只会给他碍手碍脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll only get in the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 她同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - She said okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一定要互相照应\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look out for one another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一起来吗 珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming, Jan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe in a little while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也陪你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll stay too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你同情我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you feel sorry for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证过不会对我有差别对待的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised you wouldn't treat me any differently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊 谢谢你将我们聚在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear lord. Thank you for bringing us all together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,赐予我们食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless this food for our use, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,庇佑我们的心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and us to thy service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们的内心充满感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill our hearts with grateful praise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀归於圣父 从今日到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}And help us give you glory each day through{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的主 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ our Lord. Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:20:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.67,0:21:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.16,0:21:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管闲事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep to your own business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.31,0:22:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我在睡梦中死去 希望主能带走我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I die before I wake, I pray the Lord my soul to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 请保佑琳达和我能找到新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, God. Help Linda and me find a good home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.66,0:22:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们能一直一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keeps us together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.11,0:22:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我们能成为真正的姐妹 - 还有亲爱的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we finally be real sisters. - With good loving parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好也和我们一样讨厌家庭作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hate homework because we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是就算他们不喜欢 也行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, even if they don't, that's okay too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.07,0:22:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.29,0:24:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.90,0:24:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.04,0:24:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.27,0:24:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天父 请原谅我将要犯下的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Father, for I am about to sin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说马林斯先生就把妻子安置在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard this is where Mr Mullins keeps his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.49,0:31:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的戴着面具吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she really wear a mask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.09,0:31:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她看上去像个洋娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she looked like a doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.53,0:31:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Mullins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.54,0:31:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.91,0:31:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.90,0:31:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他看上去人不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he seems nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.13,0:31:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不去找珍妮丝 看看她在干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go find Janice, see what she's up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.01,0:31:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.13,0:31:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你们好讨论男孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can talk about boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.97,0:31:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想讨论男孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you want to talk about boys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.85,0:31:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心 不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.70,0:31:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.43,0:31:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们来玩捉迷藏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play hide and seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.94,0:31:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去躲 我们来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go hide and we'll come look for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.34,0:31:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.98,0:31:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要去找她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are we going to look for her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.16,0:31:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.65,0:31:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.24,0:31:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.33,0:32:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.80,0:32:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问了马林斯先生能不能把这个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked Mr Mullins if we could use this room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.52,0:32:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,用做我们的新教室\N{\fnArial\fs30}for our new classroom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.13,0:32:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他慷慨地同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he graciously agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.53,0:32:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.50,0:32:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.44,0:32:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做告解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a sin to confess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.46,0:32:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 夏洛特修女 我犯下了罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Sister Charlotte, for I have sinned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.96,0:32:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经 - 至少两星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's been… - At least 2 weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.01,0:32:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少两星期没有做告解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least 2 weeks since my last confession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.83,0:32:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上有个我不该进去的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this room upstairs I'm not suppose to go into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.03,0:32:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.28,0:32:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不然的话你为什么要来告诉我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because otherwise why would you be telling me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.36,0:32:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那扇门已经打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the door was already opened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.79,0:32:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么 因为马林斯先生明明锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how because Mr Mullins always keeps it locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.01,0:32:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进去后看到一个小娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I went inside there was this little doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.25,0:32:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的非常奇怪 - 珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And it was really strange. - Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.69,0:32:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始发生一些很奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird things started to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.32,0:32:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝 听听你自己说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice, listen to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.08,0:33:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I always say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.34,0:33:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪孽就是罪孽 不管是什么罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sin is a sin no matter the context.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.77,0:33:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是你绝对不能不听马林斯夫妇的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly, you absolutely cannot disobey the Mullins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.60,0:33:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才到这里 他们愿意让我们留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only just got here and they're doing a very generous thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.55,0:33:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经是非常慷慨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by allowing us to stay with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.47,0:33:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们决定不收留我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they decide to no longer have us here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.36,0:33:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会被分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll all be split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.64,0:33:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你如果还想不守规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So next time you're thinking of breaking a rule, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.26,0:33:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,先想想那会不会影响到其他女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}think of how that could've affect the other girls first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.73,0:33:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.01,0:33:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 对不起 修女 是我没好好考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm sorry, Sister, I wasn't thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.91,0:33:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,最为惩罚 你要做一次祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your penance, pray 1 Hail Mary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.12,0:33:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,并帮我收拾好三个箱子里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and unpack 3 of these boxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.30,0:33:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.85,0:33:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unpacking boxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.63,0:34:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方太恐怖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is so creepy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.41,0:35:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.26,0:35:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.00,0:35:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么敢这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.53,0:35:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,稻草人先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mr Scarecrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.94,0:36:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.84,0:36:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你躲得不是很好嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not very good at hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.58,0:36:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,年久失修 支架平衡坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years of neglect have affected the counter balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.15,0:36:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在应该不会有穿堂风了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. That should keep the draft out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.76,0:36:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.19,0:37:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在罗马尼亚拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was taken in Romania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.16,0:37:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个与世隔绝的修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a convent of cloistered nuns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.48,0:37:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们和外界世界几乎没有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have little contact with the outside world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.29,0:37:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我和她们三个关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I became very close to these three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.16,0:37:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是玛利亚修女 那是安娜修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Sister Maria. That's sister Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.43,0:37:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是卢西亚修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's Ssister Lucia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.98,0:37:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.43,0:37:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我不知道 我觉得我应该没见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… don't know. I don't think I even met her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.37,0:37:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么需要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.12,0:37:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.90,0:37:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.75,0:37:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.38,0:37:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.42,0:37:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要嫁给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one would you marry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.22,0:37:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.91,0:37:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能和每一个都交往试试才能知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll just have to date all of them to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.34,0:37:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他的眉毛怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like his eyebrows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.89,0:38:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的眼睛 - 他是不是很帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His eye. - Ain't he handsome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.89,0:38:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯太太到了晚上就会获得力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night time is when Mrs Mullins gets her powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.47,0:38:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她整天躺在床上 但到了晚上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why she's in bed all day. But at night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.06,0:38:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想去哪里都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}she can go wherever she wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.06,0:38:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她必须要出去 这样才能进食\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs to so she can feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.95,0:38:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你和她对视 你便会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you look directly at her you'll die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.52,0:38:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让你看她 她会一直叫你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to get you to look, she'll keep saying your name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.66,0:38:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍 直到你实在忍不住回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over till you can't stand it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.57,0:38:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy. Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.80,0:38:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 南茜 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nancy… - No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.10,0:38:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她准备好进食了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's ready to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.95,0:39:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔 卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol. Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.82,0:39:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.87,0:39:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该起来闹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're not suppose to be up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.24,0:39:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你也会醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you'll do it to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.42,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么不回应她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't he answering her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.69,0:40:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是她 - 别看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's her. - Don't look at her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.88,0:40:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.82,0:40:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 拜托 拜托 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please please please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.54,0:40:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.74,0:40:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.27,0:40:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.93,0:40:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走了 她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone. She's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.21,0:40:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.81,0:40:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on God's earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.00,0:40:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛特修女 - 马林斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sister Charlotte. - Mrs Mullins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚刚在这里 我们听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was here. We heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.64,0:40:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个房间里 她刚刚就站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this room, she was standing right over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.97,0:40:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.25,0:40:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife apparently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.97,0:40:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们说她刚刚站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said she was just in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.72,0:40:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.35,0:40:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子已经瘫痪在床很多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife hasn't been able to walk for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.53,0:41:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls. Girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.03,0:41:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续学习吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go back to our studies, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.89,0:41:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Nance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.68,0:41:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚真的看到马林斯太太在你们的房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really see Mrs Mullins in your room last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们发誓我们当时盖着床单…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We swear we were under the cover and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.33,0:41:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy. Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.37,0:41:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚是我们自己吓自己 你也清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just freaked ourselves out last night, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.71,0:42:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Mullins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.81,0:42:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛特修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Charlotte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.72,0:42:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,能麻烦你帮我拿一杯水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I trouble you for a glass of water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.81,0:42:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.96,0:43:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听到这房子里重新焕发生机真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to hear some life again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.12,0:43:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躺在这里太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been cooped up here so long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.06,0:43:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,都忘了人声是怎么样的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so long I forgotten what that sounded like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.87,0:43:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这照片真好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a lovely picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.78,0:43:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 她很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was taken from us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.82,0:43:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就离开了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}at an early age… unfortunately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.55,0:43:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能转过去一会儿吗 修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could turn away for a moment, Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.27,0:43:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.75,0:43:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你女儿的事感到很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry to hear about your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.20,0:43:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但想到她会在天堂等着你们 我们也会宽慰不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we find comfort in knowing she waits for you in heaven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.87,0:43:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that were true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.31,0:45:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my Gosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.71,0:45:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.10,0:45:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, neither should you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.16,0:45:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房间到底是谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's room is this anyways?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.29,0:45:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯夫妇曾经有个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mullins had a daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.23,0:45:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was her's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.17,0:45:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.35,0:45:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.78,0:46:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那个音乐也是她放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think that was her playing the music too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.93,0:46:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吓我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop trying to scare me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.79,0:46:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. It's the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.70,0:46:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们为什么还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are we in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.66,0:46:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该走了 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should leave. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.30,0:46:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.11,0:46:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.07,0:46:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't be in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.08,0:46:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.53,0:46:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave in a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.30,0:46:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.00,0:47:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's doing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.55,0:48:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.91,0:49:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是马林斯夫妇的女儿 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the Mullins' daughter… aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.73,0:49:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.20,0:49:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.05,0:49:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.34,0:49:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.50,0:49:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlotte!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.24,0:49:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛特修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Charlotte!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.76,0:51:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.12,0:53:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.01,0:53:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她一点空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her some space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.01,0:53:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.51,0:53:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝现在有点低落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice is feeling a little down right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.28,0:53:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要尽我们所能支持她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we need to do what we can to support her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.72,0:53:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她现在需要的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time I think is all she needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.77,0:53:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能重新走路的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll walk again, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.70,0:53:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.24,0:53:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该睡一觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.59,0:53:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样能帮你恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's going to help you with the healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.56,0:53:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能留在这里 夏洛特修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stay here, sister Charlotte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.92,0:53:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.76,0:53:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.54,0:53:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.05,0:53:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And go where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.35,0:53:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无处可去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't anywhere else for us to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.83,0:53:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是摔下楼梯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't fall down those stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.40,0:53:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有东西把我丢下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something threw me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.92,0:53:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.38,0:54:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always say that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.42,0:54:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们看不到上帝 我们也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though we can't see God we can…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.32,0:54:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也能感受到他的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can feel his presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.04,0:54:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个房子里我感受到了另一种存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this house I feel a different kind of presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.19,0:54:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.88,0:54:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An evil one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.96,0:54:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming after me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.98,0:54:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要得到我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming after my soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.42,0:54:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You soul?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.96,0:54:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是最弱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm the weakest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.06,0:54:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.10,0:54:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.58,0:54:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔只会盯上那些信仰不坚定的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil preys on those weak in faith, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.32,0:54:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是身体羸弱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not weak of flesh and bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.99,0:54:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们一样强 珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are as strong as any of us, Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.93,0:54:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.25,0:55:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很安静 塞穆尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quiet, Samuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.66,0:55:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得让那些女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was a mistake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.58,0:55:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在这里是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring the girls here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.88,0:55:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.55,0:55:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.79,0:55:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个摔下来的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl that fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.73,0:55:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她不是摔下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she didn't fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.33,0:55:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.61,0:55:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.25,0:55:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.36,0:55:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常会有意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accidents happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.62,0:55:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经沉寂了12年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been quiet for 12 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.52,0:55:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该努力接受那些女孩们的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try embracing the presence of the girls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.65,0:55:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是把她们吓跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of frightening them away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.64,0:55:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be better soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.82,0:55:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.72,0:56:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.86,0:56:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.22,0:56:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们会找到一个新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said we'll find a new home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.59,0:56:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没人会要我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is going to want me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.02,0:56:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会是一个负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just be a burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.37,0:56:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你发过誓我们俩会永远一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you swore we'll stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.43,0:56:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.77,0:56:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不会有人收养我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I won't get adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.59,0:56:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.32,0:56:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.66,0:56:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你很特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.22,0:56:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被一个很美好的家庭收养\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to get adopted by a nice family somewhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.09,0:56:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会非常非常宠爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're going to spoil you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.34,0:56:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有很多很多娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to have so many dolls that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.22,0:56:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至连名字都起不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't even be able to name all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.55,0:56:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.21,0:56:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.90,0:56:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝二号 珍妮丝三号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice Two. Janice Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.82,0:56:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 该上床睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda. Time for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.35,0:57:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不上楼来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you come upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.78,0:57:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想一个人睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to sleep alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.95,0:57:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.36,0:57:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Becca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.43,0:57:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.75,0:57:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能一直陪着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll always be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.91,0:57:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把苏宝贝给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, you should have Sweet Sue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.91,0:57:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.23,0:57:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得在来到这里之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember before all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.24,0:57:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在孤儿院时经常半夜溜出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we used to sneak around the orphanage at night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.49,0:57:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后去食品储藏间吃巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ate all the chocolate in the pantry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.23,0:57:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,马赛神父一直以为我们害老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Massey was convinced that we had mice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.98,0:57:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊 请你洗涤我灵魂的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Lord, please cleanse my soul of my sins{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.74,0:57:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚我们房中的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cleanse our house of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.40,0:57:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些老鼠 - 那些老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- these mice. - these mice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.25,0:58:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.81,0:58:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是会想到我们一起做的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking always all those things we did together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.23,0:58:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Linda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.29,0:58:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.60,1:03:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,晒点太阳对你有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little sunlight will do you some good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.41,1:03:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得晒太阳也没法解决我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think the sunlight can fix what's wrong with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.70,1:03:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对不能放弃希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mustn't give up hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.61,1:03:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望是一个家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope is a home onto itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.14,1:03:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走进其中 就会得到庇佑和保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwell in it and it will protect and keep you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.02,1:03:36.54,Title,0,0,0,0,,这是出自《圣经》的哪一部\N{\fnArial\fs30}What book of the Bible is that from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.42,1:03:40.35,Title,0,0,0,0,,出自《夏洛蒂之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book of Charlotte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.96,1:03:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不说明这话没有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't make it any less so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.08,1:03:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己在这里没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.41,1:03:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳光感觉的确不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sunlight actually feels kind of nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.59,1:03:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.43,1:04:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太低了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.89,1:04:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛特修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Charlotte?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.97,1:04:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.23,1:04:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.95,1:06:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.30,1:06:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.99,1:06:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.26,1:06:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.91,1:06:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.36,1:06:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.81,1:06:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worry about Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.73,1:06:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个晚上之前她还很想走\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few nights ago she wanted to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.82,1:06:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么她想走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why she want to leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.35,1:06:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能因为这个地方太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably because this place is off the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.36,1:06:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉我马林斯的女儿盯上了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me the Mullins's daughter was coming for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.95,1:07:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯夫妇有一个女儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mullins' had a daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.78,1:07:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很久以前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.44,1:07:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她是见鬼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, she's seeing ghost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.31,1:07:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音轻一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your voice down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.41,1:07:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她是见鬼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, she's seeing ghost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.15,1:07:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.10,1:07:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也看到了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… You guys saw something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.41,1:07:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.00,1:07:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有死人才能算是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost can only be of dead people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.20,1:07:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们看到的东西怎么解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that explain what you saw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.69,1:07:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非那真的是马林斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless it really was Mrs Mullins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.44,1:07:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者…是什么东西想吓你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or… something was just trying to scare you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.65,1:07:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个讨论得还挺起劲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are doing a good job with that on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.06,1:07:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝可能只是在想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice is probably just looking for ways{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.21,1:07:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们给她特殊待遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}to justify us treating her differently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.07,1:07:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.69,1:07:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然不觉得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.03,1:07:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你长大了就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll know what I mean when you're older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.28,1:07:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,上床去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go get to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.03,1:08:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.97,1:08:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.75,1:08:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.94,1:08:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.07,1:08:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算什么最得意之作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my finest work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.16,1:08:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来有心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem troubled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.77,1:09:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.72,1:09:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.66,1:09:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候可能你只是需要说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking about the things that bothers us sometimes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.76,1:09:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,困扰你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the help we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.21,1:09:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.21,1:09:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她表现得很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's acting funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.49,1:09:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现得很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acting funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.38,1:09:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.06,1:09:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她见到了你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's seen your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.62,1:09:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.87,1:09:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经去世很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been dead for a very very long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.40,1:09:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.43,1:09:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝进了她的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Janice went into her bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.83,1:09:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.89,1:09:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道她不该进去 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows she wasn't suppose to but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.75,1:09:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她找到了一个娃娃 然后… - 什么娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- she found this doll and… - What doll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.55,1:09:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿白裙子的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one in the white dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.14,1:09:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.74,1:10:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那娃娃已经藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doll was hidden away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.77,1:10:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她绝对不能靠近那个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She mustn't go near that doll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.68,1:10:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.65,1:11:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝 我和你说了不要进那个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice, I told you not to use that room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.68,1:11:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要夺走我的阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Please don't take my sunshine away*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.61,1:12:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.29,1:12:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Mullins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.61,1:12:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯先生 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Mullins, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.38,1:12:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备上床睡觉吧 姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get ready for bed, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.48,1:12:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得找马林斯太太谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak to Mrs Mullins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.28,1:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.65,1:16:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.99,1:16:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它伤害了珍妮丝 还杀了马林斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hurting Janice and it killed Mr Mullins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.23,1:16:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要丢掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting rid of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.08,1:16:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 我们回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda, let's go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.06,1:16:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.43,1:16:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.01,1:17:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.99,1:17:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他是什么 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.73,1:17:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝 珍妮丝 我扔掉它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice. Janice. I got rid of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.36,1:17:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扔掉那个娃娃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got rid of the doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.27,1:17:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.69,1:17:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.09,1:17:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 珍妮丝在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Where is Janice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.94,1:17:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Go find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.12,1:17:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.87,1:17:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.14,1:17:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.12,1:17:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 把那东西离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Get that thing away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.16,1:17:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.72,1:17:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it was back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.71,1:17:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.57,1:17:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.79,1:18:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.79,1:18:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.69,1:18:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞穆尔和我 失去我们的女儿后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Samuel and I… lost our daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.66,1:18:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终日祈祷 只要能让我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we prayed and promised our devotion to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.05,1:18:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次见到我们的爱女\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever power that would allow us to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.49,1:18:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜求助了一些不明不白的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}speak or see our beloved girl again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.30,1:18:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始那些联系很微弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started small, the contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.03,1:18:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但的确是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.16,1:18:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our busy Bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.27,1:18:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know it was her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.63,1:18:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想要我们允许她进入娃娃的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted permission to move into the doll{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.37,1:18:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样她就能永远陪着我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she could be with us forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.58,1:18:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们答应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We said yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.38,1:18:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那些联系开始变得强烈起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when it became stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.26,1:19:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快我们就能看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon we can actually see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.42,1:19:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然只有短短几瞥 但那也够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only in fleeting glimpses but it was enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.06,1:19:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最爱的小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our beloved Bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.52,1:19:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.19,1:19:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annabelle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.95,1:19:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我没法抱住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though I couldn't hold her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.14,1:19:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,能像以前一样 真的很安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was comforting to start the past activity again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.41,1:19:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们马上发现 那根本不是安娜贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we soon realised it wasn't our Annabelle at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.01,1:19:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的阳光 我唯一的阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}*You are my sunshine, my only sunshine*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.25,1:19:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当天空灰暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}*You make me happy*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.63,1:19:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你让我快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}*when skies are gray*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.32,1:20:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}*You'll never know dear*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.28,1:20:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有多爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}*how much I love you*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.53,1:20:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要夺走我的阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Please don't take my sunshine away*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.75,1:20:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Esther?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.92,1:20:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Esther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.90,1:20:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的…眼睛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My… eye…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.81,1:20:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a demonic presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.03,1:20:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它利用安娜贝尔控制我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was using our Annabelle to manipulate us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.69,1:21:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它得到想要的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}into giving it soul it couldn't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.40,1:21:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想夺走我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tried to take mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.47,1:21:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是塞穆尔去了教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Samuel reached out to the church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.12,1:21:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拯救了我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saved my soul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.72,1:21:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那个恶魔仍然附身在娃娃身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the evil was still attached to that doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.29,1:21:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们把它锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we locked it away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.66,1:21:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,用圣经将它禁锢起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it could be surrounded by the word of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.89,1:22:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它沉寂了这么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was quiet for all these year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.20,1:22:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为恶魔已经被控制住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the evil was contained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.00,1:22:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为帮助那些女孩是在为自己赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought helping the girls could be our penance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.63,1:22:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在看来 却让它如愿以偿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we end up giving it just what it wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.05,1:22:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的阳光 我唯一的阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}*You are my sunshine, my only sunshine*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.71,1:22:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当天空灰暗 是你让我快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}*You make me happy when skies are gray*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.97,1:22:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的你不知道 - 珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- *You'll never know dear* - Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.45,1:22:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有多爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}*how much I love you*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.14,1:22:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要夺走我的阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Please don't take my sunshine away*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.84,1:22:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.83,1:22:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们 珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just us, Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.03,1:22:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候停止所有的罪孽了 卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to cease from sin, Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.06,1:22:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛特修女 夏洛特修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Charlotte! Sister Charlotte!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.81,1:22:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…是珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's-it's Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.19,1:22:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她…她… - 看看她都做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's… She's… - Look what she did!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.94,1:22:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡萝尔 快去求助 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carol, call for help. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.74,1:23:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待在一起 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And stay together. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.00,1:23:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们马上来了 我们去安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on their way. Let get somewhere safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.93,1:23:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.31,1:23:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这么把她丢在这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave her here, can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.75,1:23:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Mullins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.92,1:23:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Mullins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.37,1:23:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Mullins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.20,1:23:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.86,1:24:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.39,1:24:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,修女 原谅我的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Sister, for I have sinned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.24,1:24:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛特修女 夏洛特修女 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sister Charlotte! Sister Charlotte! - Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.54,1:24:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.13,1:24:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 蒂尔尼 去找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Tierney! Get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.71,1:24:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.77,1:24:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.84,1:25:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.62,1:25:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.30,1:25:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关门 关门 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close the door! Close the door! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.68,1:25:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.84,1:25:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.43,1:25:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.45,1:25:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.23,1:25:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.83,1:25:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发动不起来 - 我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not starting! - I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.04,1:25:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.71,1:25:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 伙计们 - 什么 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys! Guys! - What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.73,1:25:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scarecrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.02,1:25:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What scarecrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.18,1:25:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.85,1:26:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯特 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kate. - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.28,1:26:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.42,1:26:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.74,1:26:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.88,1:26:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.44,1:26:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 我打不开门 锁上了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, I can't get the door open. Is it locked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.19,1:26:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边能打开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get it from your side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.34,1:26:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.60,1:26:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.61,1:28:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.60,1:28:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.05,1:29:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊 帮帮我 主啊 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, help me. Lord, help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.68,1:29:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,救…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.71,1:29:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.17,1:29:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.23,1:29:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.55,1:30:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.14,1:32:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's loon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.04,1:32:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.27,1:32:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.80,1:33:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛特修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Charlotte?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.88,1:34:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最喜欢苏宝贝哪一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I like most about Sweet Sue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.81,1:34:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看上去和你很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks just like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.67,1:34:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.66,1:35:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里 琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, Linda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.88,1:35:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.66,1:35:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 出来玩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda, come out and play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.66,1:35:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.75,1:35:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发过誓如果我找到家 你要和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swore if I found a home you'd come too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.04,1:35:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道违背誓言会有什么下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they say about breaking a swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.66,1:35:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会直接下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go straight to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.08,1:35:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.08,1:36:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.45,1:36:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.40,1:36:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.93,1:36:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.15,1:36:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.81,1:37:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.20,1:37:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛特修女 - 夏洛特修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sister Charlotte! - Sister Charlotte!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.42,1:38:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.28,1:38:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.30,1:38:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是找不到那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no sign of the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.37,1:38:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她年纪这么小…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at her age…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.79,1:39:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跑多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}how far could she'd gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.95,1:39:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.30,1:39:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.94,1:39:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个房子已经受到净化\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house is blessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.84,1:39:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的邪魔已经不复存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever evil was here is no longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.24,1:39:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.93,1:39:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.80,1:39:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是恶魔的载体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a conduit for the evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.67,1:39:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔已经离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That evil has moved on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.27,1:39:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这个娃娃只是个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the doll is just a doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.65,1:39:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.85,1:39:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}which one of you gets this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.32,1:40:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you holding up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.45,1:40:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.91,1:40:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时的珍妮丝不是她自己 而是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that wasn't Janice back there. That was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.87,1:40:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.65,1:40:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.02,1:41:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi there. Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.30,1:41:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们直接进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go right inside, shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.10,1:41:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一般不怎么说话 有些安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}She mostly keeps to herself, that can be a bit quite, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.96,1:41:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她是个可爱的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's a lovely girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.89,1:41:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是经历了太多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just been through a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.37,1:41:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们会喜欢她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you will love her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.10,1:41:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.91,1:41:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来见你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone here to see you, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.94,1:41:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两位是希金斯先生和希金斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to introduce you to Mr and Mrs Higgins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.26,1:41:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you must be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.94,1:41:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安娜贝尔 - 安娜贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Annabelle. - Annabelle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.39,1:41:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名字真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a lovely name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.42,1:41:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你带了礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought you a present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.83,1:41:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you like dolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.98,1:42:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到了吗 - 听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hear that? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.75,1:42:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.18,1:42:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.30,1:42:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.77,1:42:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 没事的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's alright, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.95,1:42:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是去看一看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to take a quick look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.29,1:42:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.88,1:43:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安娜贝尔 - 你好 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Annabelle? - Hi, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.00,1:43:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
